    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Dollmaker</strong> is a <strong>psychological survival puzzle</strong> game where you are trapped in an <strong>abandoned hospital</strong>, forced to undergo a horrifying test by a <strong>sadistic inventor</strong> known only as <strong>The Dollmaker</strong>. He has chosen you as his next experiment, seeking to determine if you are &quot;<strong>suitable for Enhancement</strong>&quot; \u2014 a grotesque transformation into one of his twisted creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you navigate the hospital's decaying halls, you must <strong>solve devious puzzles</strong> and <strong>manipulate the environment</strong> to <strong>unlock your escape</strong>. But you're not <strong>alone</strong>. <strong>The Dollmaker's creations</strong> \u2014 <strong>grotesque</strong>, <strong>mechanical dolls</strong> that were <strong>once human</strong> \u2014 will stop at nothing to keep you from escaping. <strong>These relentless horrors lurk around every corner</strong>, each one more <strong>dangerous</strong> and cunning than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each puzzle you solve brings you closer to the truth about the <strong>Dollmaker\u2019s dark obsession</strong>, but also deeper into his <strong>sadistic game</strong>. Will you be able to outsmart his <strong>traps</strong> and the Creations hunting you? Can you keep your sanity intact as you unravel the mysteries of the <strong>Dollmaker\u2019s twisted experiments</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The clock is ticking</strong>, and every choice you make will determine whether you <strong>escape</strong> the Dollmaker\u2019s labyrinth \u2014 or become just another piece of his<strong>\u00a0collection</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve intricate, environment-based puzzles that challenge your wits and resilience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362850/extras/8babcd67985356b309a669286123182e.poster.avif?t=1736768049\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362850/extras/8babcd67985356b309a669286123182e.webm?t=1736768049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362850/extras/8babcd67985356b309a669286123182e.mp4?t=1736768049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape deadly traps set by the Dollmaker to test your ability to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter terrifying creations \u2014 the Dollmaker\u2019s twisted mechanical dolls \u2014 who will relentlessly pursue you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Your Knowledge and instinct in order to combat and fight off The Dollmakers Horrific Creations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362850/extras/339bb8062b7ac97df6d4b751d2d298eb.poster.avif?t=1736768049\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362850/extras/339bb8062b7ac97df6d4b751d2d298eb.webm?t=1736768049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362850/extras/339bb8062b7ac97df6d4b751d2d298eb.mp4?t=1736768049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the dark secrets of the Dollmaker\u2019s experiments and his horrific quest for &quot;Enhancement.&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chilling atmosphere filled with suspense, mystery, and psychological tension.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive the Dollmaker, or will you become his next creation?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Dollmaker</strong> is a <strong>psychological survival puzzle</strong> game where you are trapped in an <strong>abandoned hospital</strong>, forced to undergo a horrifying test by a <strong>sadistic inventor</strong> known only as <strong>The Dollmaker</strong>. He has chosen you as his next experiment, seeking to determine if you are &quot;<strong>suitable for Enhancement</strong>&quot; \u2014 a grotesque transformation into one of his twisted creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you navigate the hospital's decaying halls, you must <strong>solve devious puzzles</strong> and <strong>manipulate the environment</strong> to <strong>unlock your escape</strong>. But you're not <strong>alone</strong>. <strong>The Dollmaker's creations</strong> \u2014 <strong>grotesque</strong>, <strong>mechanical dolls</strong> that were <strong>once human</strong> \u2014 will stop at nothing to keep you from escaping. <strong>These relentless horrors lurk around every corner</strong>, each one more <strong>dangerous</strong> and cunning than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each puzzle you solve brings you closer to the truth about the <strong>Dollmaker\u2019s dark obsession</strong>, but also deeper into his <strong>sadistic game</strong>. Will you be able to outsmart his <strong>traps</strong> and the Creations hunting you? Can you keep your sanity intact as you unravel the mysteries of the <strong>Dollmaker\u2019s twisted experiments</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The clock is ticking</strong>, and every choice you make will determine whether you <strong>escape</strong> the Dollmaker\u2019s labyrinth \u2014 or become just another piece of his<strong>\u00a0collection</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve intricate, environment-based puzzles that challenge your wits and resilience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_par